      "title": "Navigating Programmatically",
      "sourceHash": "f5e7cfcb5382cd471fc5b9b6922d63d3d856389719d7637a5727acdc3b874864",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 2.903,
          "en": "Okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.903,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "We're making good progress",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.11,
          "end": 7.92,
          "en": "and we're almost ready to dive into more advanced features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.92,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "but before we do that, there are still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "some other basic features you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "For example, imperative routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 18.99,
          "en": "Right now, we allow users to navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.99,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "between our pages by providing links which can be clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.62,
          "end": 25.95,
          "en": "and I will say right away that this is the default way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 29.04,
          "en": "of providing navigation to users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.04,
          "end": 31.11,
          "en": "but it's not the only way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "In some situations, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 36.03,
          "en": "maybe because some forum was submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.03,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "or because some timer expired,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 39.66,
          "en": "you might want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 43.23,
          "en": "trigger a navigation action from inside Code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.23,
          "end": 45.45,
          "en": "and you can do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.45,
          "end": 48.39,
          "en": "by using another special feature provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.39,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "by react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 53.62,
          "en": "You can import the useNavigate hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.51,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "and call that in your functional components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 61.953,
          "en": "to get access to a navigate function, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 65.22,
          "en": "and this navigate function can be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.22,
          "end": 67.35,
          "en": "to trigger a navigation action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.35,
          "end": 71.22,
          "en": "So, to switch to a different route from inside your code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.22,
          "end": 72.753,
          "en": "So, programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.86,
          "end": 78.36,
          "en": "For example, here I could add my navigateHandler function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.36,
          "end": 80.7,
          "en": "and connect that to a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.7,
          "end": 81.99,
          "en": "and this, by the way, is something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.99,
          "end": 84.66,
          "en": "I'm only doing for this example here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.66,
          "end": 86.61,
          "en": "Of course, you should not create buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.61,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "and then navigate programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 90.96000000000001,
          "en": "Simply use a link instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.96000000000001,
          "end": 92.31,
          "en": "but a button is a great way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.31,
          "end": 95.55,
          "en": "for me to show you how this generally works here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 98.37,
          "en": "So, here I'll add a button where, upon a click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 101.1,
          "en": "I want to trigger the navigateHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 103.05,
          "en": "Again, not something you wanna do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.05,
          "end": 105.21000000000001,
          "en": "but good enough for this demo here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.21000000000001,
          "end": 108.36,
          "en": "and then in here we can call the navigate function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.36,
          "end": 109.32,
          "en": "and then for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.32,
          "end": 113.463,
          "en": "navigate to /products or any other path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.02000000000001,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "If we add this code, we get this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 120.15,
          "en": "and if I click this button, we navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 122.22,
          "en": "This time programmatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 123.93,
          "en": "even though it's upon a button click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.93,
          "end": 126.12,
          "en": "but the button click only triggered a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.12,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "and inside that function, we then had the actual code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 132.57,
          "en": "the programmatic imperative navigation code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.57,
          "end": 135.06,
          "en": "for moving to a different page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 138,
          "en": "Again, you should use a link instead of this approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 140.94,
          "en": "but this is how you would navigate programmatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 143.57999999999998,
          "en": "if you would need to do so, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.57999999999998,
          "end": 147.27,
          "en": "because some timer expired or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.27,
          "end": 149.04,
          "en": "It is something which I also wanted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 149.04,
          "end": 151.38,
          "en": "to mention here for completeness sake,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.38,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "even though we don't need it on this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 155.88,
          "en": "but you might need it in other applications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 155.88,
          "end": 159.363,
          "en": "and now you know how you can navigate programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
